<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
    <dict>
        <key>Description</key>
        <string>Hands the Windows App Runtime framework package (an .msix that the download recipe took out of Microsoft's redistributable zip) to CimianImporter, which publishes it as a new version of the item into a Cimian repository (as a copy of the item's newest pkginfo, with what belongs to the installer file replaced), or says that nothing is new. The recipe gives no version label: for an app package CimianImporter takes the package's own Identity Version (the four numbers of the framework, which look like 4000.1309.2056.0, not the release 1.4). It refuses a package whose identity name is not the one of the msix installs entry of the item's newest pkginfo. Without a template the pkginfo is built from the inputs, and the package's ProcessorArchitecture becomes its supported_architectures, so the first pkginfo names one architecture. The importers accept the download as verified only because the extractor hands them the package's hash after the zip's hash matched. The cimian recipe ran once under AutoPkg 2.9.0 into a scratch Cimian repository on 2026-11-16 (a dry run, a real run that published the item, a second run that said nothing is new). On 2026-11-16 the published x64 package was provisioned alone with Add-AppxProvisionedPackage on one Windows 11 test PC; that the same install happens through the Cimian client is NOT established. This is a dry run, which writes nothing, until the recipe's override sets cimian_dry_run to false. The repository is the input cimian_repo or the AutoPkg preference CIMIAN_REPO.</string>
        <key>Identifier</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.cimian.WindowsAppRuntime</string>
        <key>Input</key>
        <dict>
            <key>CIMIAN_NAME</key>
            <string>WindowsAppRuntime.1.4</string>
            <key>CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY</key>
            <string></string>
            <key>NAME</key>
            <string>WindowsAppRuntime</string>
            <key>pkginfo</key>
            <dict>
                <key>developer</key>
                <string>Microsoft Corporation</string>
                <key>display_name</key>
                <string>Windows App Runtime 1.4</string>
            </dict>
        </dict>
        <key>MinimumVersion</key>
        <string>1.0.0</string>
        <key>ParentRecipe</key>
        <string>com.github.serrc-techops.download.WindowsAppRuntime-Win</string>
        <key>Process</key>
        <array>
            <dict>
                <key>Processor</key>
                <string>com.github.serrc-techops.SharedProcessors/CimianImporter</string>
                <key>Arguments</key>
                <dict>
                    <key>pathname</key>
                    <string>%pathname%</string>
                    <key>cimian_name</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_NAME%</string>
                    <key>cimian_subdirectory</key>
                    <string>%CIMIAN_SUBDIRECTORY%</string>
                    <key>version</key>
                    <string></string>
                </dict>
            </dict>
        </array>
    </dict>
</plist>
